percona-server (8.0.44-35~int03) unstable; urgency=medium

  * [INT03] guard against use-after-free in Item_cache::walk()
  * [INT03] Do not force-flush worker position on every commit when GTID auto-positioning can recover it
  * PS-10448 [8.0]: An insert prepared statement fails to write across partitions
  * [INT03] Fix crash in buf_pool_register_chunk() during online buffer pool resize
  * [INT03] Added march/mtune to CFLAGS/CXXFLAGS
  * [INT03] hardware CRC32 implementation using Intel PCLMULQDQ
  * [INT03] Add innodb_large_page_populate to control huge page pre-population
  * [INT03] Buffer pool partial & lazy initialization groundwork
  * [INT03] Reduce context switches in TTASEventMutex spin_and_try_lock()
  * [INT03] Make ut_delay() deterministic
  * [INT03] Buffer pool initialization speedup
  * [INT03] CPU binding routines for server
  * [INT03] CPU Topology moved from innodb to sql directory
  * [INT03] reduce rw_lock_list contention during buffer pool init

